  "id": "2076460501123653774",
  "text": "Staying on top of tons of agents is hard.\n\nUnless you're using atrium.\n\nSee all of your agents at a glance with all of the signal you need to know when and where you're needed:\n\n- Permissions requests\n- Question menus\n- Errors\n- Turn ended\n\nAnd all this in a fully configurable surface:\n\n- Change density\n- Group by project or status\n- Maximize, expand, or collapse sections\n\nYou can even send a message directly to an agent from the sidebar. Pop open the Omni-chat or pop out the entire pane to have a full-blown conversation.\n\nIf you run a lot of agents, you need this!\n\n👉 http://getatrium.dev",
